# Media-app launcher logos: proprietary brand icons, kept out of the repo like the APKs. Present in your local build (shown on the home
# tiles); absent elsewhere, where the tiles fall back to each app's short mark (src/media/apps.ts, HomeView AppTileIcon).
public/logos/

